{"id":304,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"WASEDAスピリッツで世界へ伸びる","feature_description":"早稲田佐賀中学校・高等学校は、早稲田大学の精神を根底に、確かな学力と人間力を育む学校です。中高一貫教育で学力養成と豊かな人間性を両立し、早稲田大学の伝統を生かした学びや、寮生活を含む学校生活の中で、世界で活躍するための視野と自立心を育てます。公式サイトの学校案内や教育ページが整理され、学びの方針と学校生活の両面を確認しやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":5424,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5425,"name":"競走部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5426,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5427,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5428,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5429,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5430,"name":"応援部（チアリーディング）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5431,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5432,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5433,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5434,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5435,"name":"放送部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5436,"name":"サイエンス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.wasedasaga.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5437,"nam